<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="utf-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
<title>zwoTrainer – third-party licences</title>
<style>
  :root { color-scheme: light dark; }
  body { font: 15px/1.5 -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, "Segoe UI", Roboto, sans-serif; max-width: 860px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 32px 20px; }
  h1 { font-size: 24px; } h2 { font-size: 18px; margin-top: 40px; }
  ul.overview { columns: 2; }
  ul.crates { padding-left: 18px; font-size: 14px; }
  pre { white-space: pre-wrap; font-size: 12.5px; padding: 14px; border: 1px solid #8884; border-radius: 8px; }
  a { color: #00a3c4; }
</style>
</head>
<body>
<h1>Third-party licences</h1>
<p>zwoTrainer is released under the MIT License (© SteffenR). It is built with the open-source Rust crates listed below, under their own licences.</p>
<h2>Overview</h2>
<ul class="overview">
{{#each overview}}<li><a href="#{{id}}">{{name}}</a> ({{count}})</li>
{{/each}}</ul>
{{#each licenses}}
<h2 id="{{id}}">{{name}}</h2>
<p>Used by:</p>
<ul class="crates">
{{#each used_by}}<li><a href="{{#if crate.repository}}{{crate.repository}}{{else}}https://crates.io/crates/{{crate.name}}{{/if}}">{{crate.name}} {{crate.version}}</a></li>
{{/each}}</ul>
<pre>{{text}}</pre>
{{/each}}
</body>
</html>
